{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>When you come into the land of Canaan.</b> Like (II Chronicles 15:8): ״והנבואה עודד הנביא״." "<b>This is the land that shall fall to you as an inheritance, the land of Canaan according to its borders.</b> The division of the land is called a 'falling' because it was divided by lot, as is said (Numbers 26:56): ״אך בגורל יחלק את הארץ״, and this is why it mentions 'falling' — the language of casting a lot." "<b>By way of the Midrash:</b> ״אשר תפול לכם״ — this teaches that the Holy One, blessed be He, caused the princes of the seven nations to fall from heaven and bound them before Moses and said to him: See that there is no more strength in them."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {0 "Source cites דברי הימים ב ט״ו:ח׳; normalized to II Chronicles 15:8."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:48.861396147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}